WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.200
♪♪

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.667
-Let's get to the news!

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.400
While speaking to reporters
last week

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.701
about the ongoing investigation

00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:12.033
into classified documents
found at his home,

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.634
President Biden defended
his handling of the files

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:18.000
that had been discovered and
said he has "no regrets."

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.267
Well, technically,
he didn't say it.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:23.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:26.601
President Biden's attorney
announced on Saturday

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:28.968
that FBI agents found six more
classified documents

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:30.801
during a search
of his Delaware home.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.767
Oh, my God, how long
is this gonna go on?

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.701
I don't have that many
un-classified documents

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:39.434
in my house.
And how big is Biden's house?

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:41.400
Every day, there's a new update,
like, "Oops,

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.400
just found some
in the guest library."

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.400
[ Laughter ]
Also, you know they're onto you.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.467
Why wouldn't you get everything
all gathered up?

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:51.033
When you were in college, and
the cops knocked on your door,

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:53.434
did you just flush
some of the weed?

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:54.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:56.767
I don't get it.
Do all politicians do this?

00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:59.634
Is that why Jimmy Carter
is still building houses?

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:01.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:04.167
Just to store
all his classified documents?

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.534
I think they're worried
I'm gonna do my Carter.

00:01:09.534 --> 00:01:13.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:16.033
Former Secretary of State
Mike Pompeo's new memoir

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:18.501
is set to be released this week,
and just to save time,

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:20.767
the title of the book
is "80 Percent Off."

00:01:20.767 --> 00:01:24.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:27.868
"Oh, don't look
in these new houses."

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:32.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.033
The Senate was set to reconvene
this afternoon at 3:00

00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:36.334
after a 20-day break because

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:38.734
nothing says
"Let's get down to business"

00:01:38.734 --> 00:01:41.334
like starting work
at 3:00 on a Monday.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:45.200
Three men in California
were recently arrested

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.801
for attempting to rob
a cannabis dispensary

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.367
after they led police
on a high-speed chase

00:01:50.367 --> 00:01:53.000
and crashed into a solar panel.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.801
Man, that sounds
like you asked your grandpa

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:58.567
to make up a news story
about California.

00:01:58.567 --> 00:02:00.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.334
A horse in Australia

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:04.567
was recently spotted
in the back seat of a car

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:06.267
entering a McDonald's
drive-through,

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:09.234
but not leaving.

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:11.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:18.234
So I can't tell.
Yea on that joke or neigh?

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:21.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:26.834
Pretty good restraint.

00:02:26.834 --> 00:02:29.334
Mike Scollins wrote that joke,
and we were very worried

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:32.434
that the burger was gonna have,
like, a mane.

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:35.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:37.501
Authorities in Rhode Island
recently agreed

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:39.534
to a child's request
to DNA-test

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:42.334
leftover Christmas cookies
for evidence of Santa Claus.

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:44.634
And they're not gonna like
what they found out.

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:48.734
Uh-oh, looks like Santa
murdered a guy in '96.

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:55.400
Public health officials
in Massachusetts

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.734
have discovered
a new strain of gonorrhea

00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:00.601
that is resistant
to most antibiotics.

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:04.734
Massachusetts, where even the
gonorrhea likes to fight stuff.

00:03:04.734 --> 00:03:06.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:08.400
"You think you're better
than me, penicillin?"

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.868 --> 00:03:12.901
Finally, according to
the latest numbers,

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:16.267
"Avatar: The Way of Water"
has made $2 billion

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:18.367
at the global box office,
which is incredible.

00:03:18.367 --> 00:03:22.234
Only $1 billion more
for the movie to break even.

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:24.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.033 --> 00:03:26.234
CNN has reported that a lawyer

00:03:26.234 --> 00:03:28.167
for former vice president
Mike Pence

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:31.100
found a dozen
classified documents last week

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.734
at Pence's Indiana home.

00:03:32.734 --> 00:03:36.834
Okay, so they're just
in every home?

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:39.234
That's the only thing
that makes sense anymore.

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:42.100
When you buy a new house
and you move in,

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:45.467
there's just classified
documents sitting on the counter

00:03:45.467 --> 00:03:50.067
next to that half roll of paper
towels and box of baking soda.

00:03:50.067 --> 00:03:53.200
President Biden is expected to
spend the weekend at Camp David,

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.901
and you know
it's been a rough week

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:58.367
when you start making
your weekend plans on Tuesday.

00:03:58.367 --> 00:03:59.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.968 --> 00:04:02.634
The Justice Department
is reportedly considering plans

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:05.267
to search other locations
connected to President Biden

00:04:05.267 --> 00:04:06.467
as part of its investigation

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.334
into his handling
of classified documents,

00:04:08.334 --> 00:04:12.100
which could include everywhere
from Cold Stone to TCBY.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:17.133
According to a new poll,
nearly 60% of New York voters

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:19.767
think Republican congressman
George Santos should resign,

00:04:19.767 --> 00:04:24.334
while according to him,
180% say he shouldn't.

00:04:24.334 --> 00:04:25.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:29.267
That's his poll.
That's his internal polling.

00:04:29.267 --> 00:04:30.467
A newly surfaced video

00:04:30.467 --> 00:04:33.067
appears to show New York
congressman George Santos

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:35.334
saying that he survived
an assassination attempt.

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:36.601
I guess we can't be surprised.

00:04:36.601 --> 00:04:38.968
There's always someone
gunning for you

00:04:38.968 --> 00:04:41.000
when you're the star
of the volleyball team

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.601
at Baruch College.

00:04:42.601 --> 00:04:45.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.634 --> 00:04:47.968
Former FBI official
Charles McGonigal

00:04:47.968 --> 00:04:50.601
was arrested over the weekend
on charges of money laundering

00:04:50.601 --> 00:04:52.667
and violating sanctions
against Russia

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:54.467
while working with
a Russian oligarch.

00:04:54.467 --> 00:04:57.434
But remember, under our system,
McGonigal is innocent

00:04:57.434 --> 00:04:59.934
until Trump calls him
a good man.

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:02.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.501
A South Carolina woman
recently used winnings

00:05:04.501 --> 00:05:06.200
from a scratch-off
lottery ticket

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:10.467
to purchase a Powerball ticket
and won $150,000

00:05:10.467 --> 00:05:12.601
in what financial experts
are calling

00:05:12.601 --> 00:05:15.868
still a smarter investment
strategy than crypto.

00:05:15.868 --> 00:05:18.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:19.834
Candy company Mars
announced yesterday

00:05:19.834 --> 00:05:22.534
it will replace its
so-called M&amp;M's spokescandies

00:05:22.534 --> 00:05:23.701
in upcoming ads.

00:05:23.701 --> 00:05:26.601
Luckily, the green one's
got another gig lined up.

00:05:26.601 --> 00:05:28.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.767
"You melted
in my husband's hands."

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:35.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.167 --> 00:05:42.033
Authorities in Spain recently
raided a tobacco factory

00:05:42.033 --> 00:05:43.934
accused of exploiting workers

00:05:43.934 --> 00:05:46.868
and seized $41 million worth
of leaves and cigarettes.

00:05:46.868 --> 00:05:48.267
And to teach them a lesson,

00:05:48.267 --> 00:05:51.868
they're going to make them
smoke every last one of them.

00:05:51.868 --> 00:05:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.367
I should make whoever wrote that
smoke the joke.

00:06:02.367 --> 00:06:04.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:06.167 --> 00:06:08.801
Roll it up.

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.968
And finally --
Oh, it's Scollins.

00:06:10.968 --> 00:06:13.868
Thank you. Wally went back
to let me know who wrote it.

00:06:13.868 --> 00:06:16.467
He wanted to make sure
I could shame him by name.

00:06:16.467 --> 00:06:17.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:20.234
Mike Scollins.

00:06:20.234 --> 00:06:24.901
If you're watching,
which you probably aren't,

00:06:24.901 --> 00:06:26.801
go smoke your joke.

00:06:26.801 --> 00:06:29.601
[ Laughter ]

00:06:29.601 --> 00:06:32.267
And finally, after
Disney World's Splash Mountain

00:06:32.267 --> 00:06:33.767
officially closed yesterday,

00:06:33.767 --> 00:06:36.767
containers of water from
the ride are being sold on eBay,

00:06:36.767 --> 00:06:40.100
including one listing
for a four-ounce bottle for $4,

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:43.801
which is still way cheaper than
buying a water at Disney World.

00:06:43.801 --> 00:06:45.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.033 --> 00:06:47.667
Former Vice President
Mike Pence's lawyer

00:06:47.667 --> 00:06:50.901
reportedly found close to
a dozen classified documents

00:06:50.901 --> 00:06:52.801
last week at Pence's
Indiana home.

00:06:52.801 --> 00:06:57.167
And when Pence heard that,
he stayed white as a ghost.

00:06:57.167 --> 00:07:00.133
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.133 --> 00:07:02.534
That's right, Mike Pence's
lawyer reportedly found close

00:07:02.534 --> 00:07:04.634
to a dozen classified documents
last week

00:07:04.634 --> 00:07:06.067
at Pence's Indiana home.

00:07:06.067 --> 00:07:07.133
Man, this is starting to feel

00:07:07.133 --> 00:07:08.667
like the beginning
of the pandemic.

00:07:08.667 --> 00:07:11.634
You hear about one case,
then another.

00:07:11.634 --> 00:07:13.367
And before you know it, we're
all going to be locked in

00:07:13.367 --> 00:07:16.634
our apartments, wiping down
our mail, terrified that

00:07:16.634 --> 00:07:20.234
some classified documents
are going to get in.

00:07:20.234 --> 00:07:23.033
The Justice Department has now
launched an investigation into

00:07:23.033 --> 00:07:26.400
the dozen classified documents
found at former Vice President

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:28.467
Mike Pence's Indiana home,
and more specifically,

00:07:28.467 --> 00:07:31.234
why was Joe Biden
keeping them there?

00:07:31.234 --> 00:07:33.267
[ Laughter ]

00:07:33.267 --> 00:07:36.834
"I like to spread it out."

00:07:36.834 --> 00:07:38.901
The Senate Judiciary Committee
held a hearing yesterday

00:07:38.901 --> 00:07:41.534
in the Ticket Master's recent
mishandling of Taylor Swift

00:07:41.534 --> 00:07:43.534
concert tickets,
and let's just say

00:07:43.534 --> 00:07:45.834
we're kind of glad
we weren't there.

00:07:45.834 --> 00:07:47.767
-I'm the problem.
It's me.

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:49.734
-She's cheer captain,
and I'm on the bleachers.

00:07:49.734 --> 00:07:52.934
-We know all too well.

00:07:52.934 --> 00:07:54.868
-Oh.

00:07:54.868 --> 00:07:57.300
It's like when your mom tries
to impress your friends.

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:59.501
"Your father cheated on me,
but I'm just going

00:07:59.501 --> 00:08:03.701
to shake it off, right, kids?"

00:08:03.701 --> 00:08:06.133
House speaker Kevin McCarthy
told reporters yesterday

00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:08.901
that if the Ethics Committee
finds that New York Congressman

00:08:08.901 --> 00:08:12.000
George Santos broke the law
"then we will remove him."

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.901
So I guess it's up
to the chairman

00:08:13.901 --> 00:08:15.033
of the Ethics Committee.

00:08:15.033 --> 00:08:17.100
Oh, no, it's George Santos!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:19.567 --> 00:08:21.400
In a new interview,
Pope Francis said

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.334
he doesn't mind criticism,
and said it "helps you grow

00:08:24.334 --> 00:08:26.767
and improve things,"
because nothing says you're

00:08:26.767 --> 00:08:29.834
open to change like
still speaking Latin.

00:08:29.834 --> 00:08:33.100
[ Laughter ]

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:36.534
The FDA yesterday proposed new
guidelines that would limit

00:08:36.534 --> 00:08:38.934
lead levels in processed
baby food.

00:08:38.934 --> 00:08:40.667
A real surprise to parents,
who thought

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:42.567
the current limit was any.

00:08:42.567 --> 00:08:45.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:45.501 --> 00:08:50.133
Hm, hardly any lead.

00:08:50.133 --> 00:08:52.868
Netflix said yesterday it plans
to start cracking down

00:08:52.868 --> 00:08:55.334
on password sharing in March,
which only gives you

00:08:55.334 --> 00:08:56.701
a couple months to find
something

00:08:56.701 --> 00:08:58.067
on Netflix worth watching.

00:08:58.067 --> 00:09:03.067
You guys want to try
"Sad Norwegian Detective"?

00:09:03.067 --> 00:09:06.100
Apparently there's
eight seasons.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.701
He keeps getting sadder.

00:09:07.701 --> 00:09:09.267
[ Laughter ]

00:09:09.267 --> 00:09:11.968
The makers of the beer
Natural Light have announced

00:09:11.968 --> 00:09:13.300
a new logo and can.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.968
Incidentally, natural light

00:09:14.968 --> 00:09:16.734
is what their customers
fear most.

00:09:16.734 --> 00:09:20.000
Ahh!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.901
Shut the door!

00:09:22.901 --> 00:09:25.634
And finally, a Canadian artist
recently earned

00:09:25.634 --> 00:09:28.634
a Guinness world record
for largest spice painting

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:31.634
after she used turmeric,
paprika and clove

00:09:31.634 --> 00:09:34.567
to paint a 900 square foot
butterfly.

00:09:34.567 --> 00:09:38.534
It was supposed to 1,200 square
feet, but then she sneezed.

00:09:38.534 --> 00:09:40.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:40.167 --> 00:09:42.234
It's a very, very dumb joke.

00:09:42.234 --> 00:09:43.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:43.534 --> 00:09:45.567
According to a new report,
the Justice Department

00:09:45.567 --> 00:09:47.334
was prepared to obtain a warrant

00:09:47.334 --> 00:09:50.434
if President Biden did not agree
to last week's search

00:09:50.434 --> 00:09:51.734
of his Delaware home.

00:09:51.734 --> 00:09:54.534
Oh, he's not the kind of guy
who won't let you in.

00:09:54.534 --> 00:09:57.100
He's the kind of guy
who won't let you leave.

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:58.934
"Come on, guys."
[ Laughter ]

00:09:58.934 --> 00:10:01.400
"One more Michelob.
I'm gonna get out my guitar."

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:05.300
New York Mayor Eric Adams told
reporters yesterday

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.133
he does not believe asylum
seekers

00:10:07.133 --> 00:10:09.167
should qualify
for the same protections

00:10:09.167 --> 00:10:12.100
that require the city to provide
shelter to homeless people.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:14.367
In related news,
the Statue of Liberty

00:10:14.367 --> 00:10:15.968
walked into the Hudson River.

00:10:15.968 --> 00:10:18.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:18.701 --> 00:10:20.467
New York Congressman
George Santos

00:10:20.467 --> 00:10:22.567
gave his first floor speech
yesterday

00:10:22.567 --> 00:10:24.934
and quoted former President
Ronald Reagan,

00:10:24.934 --> 00:10:27.434
or as Santos calls him, "Dad."

00:10:27.434 --> 00:10:29.033
[ Laughter ]

00:10:29.033 --> 00:10:30.601
"My living dad."

00:10:30.601 --> 00:10:33.334
[ Laughter ]

00:10:33.334 --> 00:10:36.267
Former President Trump has
reportedly begun texting.

00:10:36.267 --> 00:10:39.501
This news first reported
by Stormy Daniels.

00:10:39.501 --> 00:10:43.567
[ Laughter ]

00:10:43.567 --> 00:10:45.000
[ Chuckles ] Throwback.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:46.801 --> 00:10:49.501
Trump has already reportedly
stopped picking up calls

00:10:49.501 --> 00:10:51.734
from numbers
that are not in his contacts,

00:10:51.734 --> 00:10:54.100
which is surprising
since you'd think he'd jump

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:57.167
at the chance to pick up
a call that says "scam likely."

00:10:57.167 --> 00:10:58.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:58.801 --> 00:11:01.934
"I think you and I are going to
have a lot in common..."

00:11:01.934 --> 00:11:03.934
[ Laughter ]
"...Scam Likely."

00:11:03.934 --> 00:11:05.601
[ Chuckles ]

00:11:05.601 --> 00:11:06.467
Transportat--

00:11:06.467 --> 00:11:07.767
That was
his Secret Service name.

00:11:07.767 --> 00:11:10.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:10.734 --> 00:11:13.033
The Transportation Department
has announced

00:11:13.033 --> 00:11:15.400
that it is in the early stages
of its investigation

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.100
into Southwest Airlines'
handling of flight cancelations

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.701
during last month's
holiday season...

00:11:19.701 --> 00:11:22.667
and should be done by the time
everyone makes it home.

00:11:22.667 --> 00:11:25.033
[ Laughter ]

00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:27.767
A new study suggests
that Earth's inner core

00:11:27.767 --> 00:11:30.801
may have stopped turning
and could go in reverse.

00:11:30.801 --> 00:11:33.300
Shouldn't have
gotten the vaccine.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.234
[ Laughter ]

00:11:39.234 --> 00:11:42.033
A passenger on an Emirates
flight to Dubai

00:11:42.033 --> 00:11:43.834
recently gave birth midflight.

00:11:43.834 --> 00:11:48.067
Not to be outdone, a passenger
on Spirit...got pregnant!

00:11:48.067 --> 00:11:52.334
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:11:55.267 --> 00:11:58.300
I just used a technique called
Amy Poehler-ing the punch line.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.667
[ Laughter ]

00:12:00.667 --> 00:12:02.601
And finally, authorities
in Connecticut

00:12:02.601 --> 00:12:04.534
are looking for a thief
who recently stole

00:12:04.534 --> 00:12:06.801
two designer bags
and a hairless cat,

00:12:06.801 --> 00:12:10.000
or as the thief believed,
three designer bags.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.234
[ Laughter ]

